# Never commit real data. Fixtures are synthetic and small; real data lives only in
# study repos, and only where the data agreement permits.
data/

# ...but the synthetic assembly reference tables under test/data/ ARE part of the suite.
# They are 24-row chromosome length/centromere tables transcribed from public UCSC files,
# not patient data, and test/test_assembly.jl asserts the shipped hg38/hg19 tables against
# them. The rule above is unanchored, so it matches test/data/ too; this re-includes the
# directory. Negating the DIRECTORY is required — git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a pattern like !test/data/*.tsv on its own would have no effect.
!test/data/

# Claude Code / superpowers working files — local only, not part of the package.
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
.claude/

